    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b436b6e41932c17101de3042",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天早上，我九点到车站前等候──\n但是不论是到了十点，还是十一点，\n爱丽速子都没有出现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76593fb7a92adff7a73f8c6d84967140f06df53b9f4db1d93ab1e56a5784154",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
